## Solution
```java[]
class Solution {
    public boolean searchMatrix(int[][] mat, int target) {
        //Intializing the row and column index
        int rowIndex = 0,colIndex = mat[0].length - 1;
        while(rowIndex >= 0 && rowIndex < mat.length && colIndex >= 0 && colIndex < mat[0].length){
            //eliminating the right as the target is lower
            if(mat[rowIndex][colIndex] < target){
                rowIndex++;
            }
            //target is found
            else if(mat[rowIndex][colIndex] == target){
                return true;
            }
             //eliminating the left as the target is higher
            else{
                colIndex--;
            }
        }
        return false;
    }
}

```

